      "content": "Thanks. That looks okay, but I'm a bit worried about the \"technical issue\" phrasing. If people dig too deep, they might start asking exactly what was hit. \n\nJust to be absolutely certain before I hit send—I saw a report from the IT team mentioned some user names and emails might have been exposed in the leak. Are we 100% sure that saying \"no sensitive information was compromised\" is accurate? I don't want us to get blindsided if a journalist asks for specifics.",
